OL,3,GNEWSAPolice tackle 144 Halloween
OL,4,Afireworks incidents across Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland received 144
OL,7,Ffireworks-related calls on Saturday
OL,8,Fnight - down on 160 on 31 October last
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,FFireworks were thrown at people,
OL,12,Fbuildings and vehicles in some parts of
OL,13,FScotland on Halloween.
OL,15,FOfficers said in general there was
OL,16,F"outstanding behaviour and
OL,17,Fco-operation" around the country but
OL,18,Fwere working to identify to those
OL,19,Fresponsible for disorder.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
