OL,3,GNEWSAPolice tackle 144 Halloween
OL,4,Afireworks incidents across Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirework Control Zones (FCZs) - where
OL,7,Fit is an offence to set off fireworks -
OL,8,Fare in place in 14 areas in Edinburgh
OL,9,Fand four in Glasgow until early
OL,10,FNovember, and dispersal zones are in
OL,11,Fforce in some places.
